    "content" : "Theorem 4.1. Suppose that Φ is convex in component-wise sense (i.e., Φ is Rm− convex) and the Assumption 1 holds. Then any sequence produced by Algorithm 3.1 converges to a WPOS x∗ ∈ Rn."
