    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "Let us deﬁne L˜ = {x ∈ Rn : Φ(x) ≤ Φ(xk), k = 0,1,2,...}. By the component-wise convexity of Φ and Lemma 4.3, for any x ∈ L˜ we have"
